@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:product;security] feedback-waits-for-tavis-review
The feedback runner MUST NOT merge a feedback pull request until Tavi has approved it, however green its
checks are: on green CI it MUST label the pull request for review and wait, with no time limit, for the
approve label, a merge Tavi made by hand, or the pull request being closed (which ends the job as declined).
New agent commits after an approval MUST take the approval away and send the pull request back to review.
Source: Tavi, 6 Nov 2026: "When someone sends feedback through the app, we need to mark that PR for me to
review, instead of letting it through directly." This replaces his 5 Nov decision to merge on green CI.
